+### Layout changes since 2026-08 (F1/F4 + RC1.1)
+
+- **F1 stepper (`form_stepper.js`):** with JS on, sections render one at a time behind a sticky "Step N of 8" header; Continue gates on the section's visible required fields. Suite default is `?stepper=off` (see preflight) — the long-form layout with all other JS on. `stepper: true` scenarios drive the stepped layout.
+- **F4 field diet:** the `listing_source` select is gone (the field stays accepted server-side — test the whitelist via `tamper_hidden_inputs`); the current-address quartet is inside a collapsed `<details data-testid="address-cluster">` (open it before filling).
+- **RC1.1:** `reference_contact_choice` (`attested`/`declined`) is mandatory server-side; the radio UI lands with RC1.2. Until then every scenario needs the injection in flow step 12 or the submit bounces with "Choose one option to continue."
+
